.TH NOIRECTL 1 "August 2026" "Noire 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
noirectl \- inspect and control the Noire daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B noirectl
.RI [ \-\-json ]
.I COMMAND
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B noirectl
uses the versioned Noire session D-Bus API. Commands include
.BR status ,
.BR devices ,
.BR start ,
.BR stop ,
.BR set ,
.BR retry ,
and
.BR diagnostics .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Emit stable, schema-versioned JSON.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the installed version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns zero on success and 2 when a request is rejected or the service is unavailable.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/noire-daemon/USER_GUIDE.md
Installed user guide and complete command examples.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/noire-daemon/TROUBLESHOOTING.md
Recovery guidance for stable error codes.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR noire (1),
.BR noired (1)
